# Inference: **${model}**

| Property | Value |
|----------|-------|
| **Endpoint** | `${base_url}` |
| **Default model** | `${model}` |
| **Token** | `${token_name}` |
| **Region** | `${region}` |

The endpoint speaks the OpenAI API, so any OpenAI client works against it by pointing its base URL
here. List what else is served with:

```sh
curl -sS -H "Authorization: Bearer $STACKIT_AI_API_KEY" "${base_url}/models" | jq -r '.data[].id'
```
